status-prompt/SKILL.md)\n- documents:documents: Create, edit, redline, and comment on `.docx`, Word, and Google  (file: r8/documents/26.601.10930/skills/documents/SKILL.md)\n- enhance-prompt: Transforms vague UI ideas into polished, Stitch-optimized prompts. (file: r1/enhance-prompt/SKILL.md)\n- google-drive:google-docs: Connector-first Google Docs creation and editing in local Codex (file: r6/google-docs/SKILL.md)\n- google-drive:google-drive: Use connected Google Drive as the single entrypoint for Drive, Do (file: r6/google-drive/SKILL.md)\n- google-drive:google-drive-comments: Write, reply to, and resolve Google Drive comments on Docs, She (file: r6/google-drive-comments/SKILL.md)\n- google-drive:google-sheets: Analyze and edit connected Google Sheets with range precision.  (file: r6/google-sheets/SKILL.md)\n- google-drive:google-slides: Google Slides work for finding, reading, summarizing, creating, (file: r6/google-slides/SKILL.md)\n- graphify: any input (code, docs, papers, images) - knowledge graph - cluster (file: r1/graphify/SKILL.md)\n- gsd:add-backlog: Add an idea to the backlog parking lot (999.x numbering) (file: r1/gsd-add-backlog/SKILL.md)\n- gsd:add-phase: Add phase to end of current milestone in roadmap (file: r1/gsd-add-phase/SKILL.md)\n- gsd:add-tests: Generate tests for a completed phase based on UAT criteria and i (file: r1/gsd-add-tests/SKILL.md)\n- gsd:add-todo: Capture idea or task as todo from current conversation context (file: r1/gsd-add-todo/SKILL.md)\n- gsd:ai-integration-phase: Generate AI design contract (AI-SPEC.md) for phases that involve b (file: r1/gsd-ai-integration-phase/SKILL.md)\n- gsd:analyze-dependencies: Analyze phase dependencies and suggest Depends on entries for ROAD (file: r1/gsd-analyze-dependencies/SKILL.md)\n- gsd:audit-fix: Autonomous audit-to-fix pipeline — find issues, classify, fix, (file: r1/gsd-audit-fix/SKILL.md)\n- gsd:audit-milestone: Audit milestone completion against original intent before archiv (file: r1/