.\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_6A.sh:19:  echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/$file (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached style references exactly. COMPOSITION: $desc $style\" | \\\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_1C.sh:20:  echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/$file (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached style references exactly. COMPOSITION: $desc $style\" | \\\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_1C.sh:29:  echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/$file (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached style references exactly. COMPOSITION: $desc $STYLE_LOGO\" | \\\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_1C.sh:94:  echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/m01_LC_b12_not-buyer_v2.png (PNG, 1600x900). The LAST attached image is the approved final scene. Reproduce it EXACTLY — same signpost, same three arrow signs pointing the same directions, same rep with headset gesturing on the left, same homeowner on the right, same poses, colors and composition — with ONE change only: the three arrow signs now carry hand-lettered black capital words, TOP sign reads AGENT, MIDDLE sign reads WAIT, BOTTOM sign reads RENT, each word centered on its sign in the same wobbly hand-drawn style. STYLE: flat sticker-sheet illustration, thick black hand-drawn outlines with a slight wobble, flat fills only (yellow, orange, cream, white, black) on cornflower-blue background, no gradients, no shadows. The ONLY text allowed is the three capital words AGENT, WAIT, RENT — one per sign, no other letters, numbers, or words anywhere. 16:9 composition, 1600x900.\" | \\\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_2A.sh:13:  echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/$file (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached style references exactly. COMPOSITION: $desc $style\" | \\\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_5B.sh:17:  echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/$file (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached style references exactly. COMPOSITION: $desc $style\" | \\\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_5B.sh:25:  echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/$file (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached style references exactly. The woman wearing the phone headset (our BMH representative) must have the IDENTICAL face to the attached headset reference image: tiny dot eyes, small simple nose, same headset. COMPOSITION: $desc $STYLE\" | \\\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_interrogation_5B.sh:11:Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/m05_L5B_interrogation.png (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached style references exactly. COMPOSITION: A dim basement interrogation room, comedic and exaggerated. On the LEFT, the BMH representative woman has the IDENTICAL face to the attached HEADSET reference image (tiny dot eyes, small nose, orange phone headset) but is dressed like a Men-in-Black agent: plain BLACK boxy suit and BLACK sunglasses, leaning in intimidatingly with one hand flat on a bare gray metal table. A single harsh cone of yellow light beams straight DOWN from a bare hanging bulb onto the table. On the RIGHT, sitting across the table, is the SAME seller as the attached SELLER reference image: IDENTICAL short dark curly hair, plain white face with tiny dot eyes, the SAME ORANGE sweater, cream pants and yellow shoes, but now NERVOUS: leaning back away from her, both hands up defensively, a few small sweat drops, worried open mouth. EXACTLY TWO clearly different people, no clone. Dim cornflower-blue basement walls, empty. Palette only. Nothing else in frame. $STYLE\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_7B.sh:26:  echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/$file (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached STYLE references for the art style and the CHARACTER anchors for the people. COMPOSITION: $desc $CAST $STYLE\" | \\\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_8A.sh:27:  echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/$file (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached style references exactly and keep the character IDENTICAL to the attached character reference. CHARACTER: $ident COMPOSITION: $desc $STYLE $NEG\" | \\\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_8A.sh:35:  gen \"m08_L8A_andrea-beach.png\" \"$AV/andrea_headset_v2.png\" \"$ANDREA\" \"EXACTLY ONE person: ANDREA relaxing at the beach, sitting comfortably in a simple doodle beach lounge chair, facing the camera directly, head upright, full face clearly visible, relaxed happy expression, hands resting easy on the chair arms. Behind her a wide cream-colored sand strip along the bottom, a large orange-and-white beach umbrella planted beside the chair, a simple wavy sea line and one or two flat doodle waves in the cornflower-blue background, a small yellow sun high in the sky. Composition centered on Andrea, her head and shoulders prominent in the middle of the frame with generous open sky around. EXACTLY ONE PERSON.\" ;;\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_8A.sh:37:  gen \"m08_L8A_b02_weight.png\" \"$A/jim.png\" \"$JIM\" \"EXACTLY ONE person: JIM standing, holding a single huge tangled black knot of rope above his head with both arms — the knot is one giant messy ball of thick tangled line, clearly heavy. His knees are slightly bent under the weight but his expression is calm and determined. Standing on a simple ground line, centered, generous open cornflower-blue space around. EXACTLY ONE PERSON.\" ;;\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_8A.sh:39:  gen \"m08_L8A_b03_underwater.png\" \"$A/marcus.png\" \"$MARCUS\" \"EXACTLY ONE person: MARCUS standing beside a simple doodle house that is sinking — a horizontal wavy WATER line crosses the middle of the house, the lower half of the house is below the water, only the roof and upper window are above it. MARCUS stands on dry ground next to it, one hand on his head, worried expression, looking at the house. Centered composition, generous open cornflower-blue space around. EXACTLY ONE PERSON.\" ;;\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_8A.sh:41:  gen \"m08_L8A_b04_response.png\" \"$A/marcus.png\" \"$MARCUS\" \"EXACTLY ONE person: MARCUS seated at a simple kitchen table, a smartphone held to his ear, several flat paper documents spread on the table in front of him, his posture easing and his expression relieved, mid-conversation. Scene composed in the LEFT and CENTER of the frame; keep the bottom-right corner area completely empty cornflower-blue (space reserved for a circle overlay). EXACTLY ONE PERSON.\" ;;\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_8A.sh:43:  gen \"m08_L8A_b05_tenants.png\" \"$A/david.png\" \"$DAVID\" \"EXACTLY THREE people: DAVID standing in the front yard of a simple two-story doodle duplex house, gesturing toward it with one open hand. In the open front doorway of the duplex stand a young couple — a man and a woman in simple doodle style (cream and orange clothing, tiny dot eyes) — standing together as the tenants. DAVID is the large foreground figure; the couple is smaller in the doorway. Centered composition. EXACTLY THREE PEOPLE, no more.\" ;;\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_8A.sh:45:  gen \"m08_L8A_b06_squatters.png\" \"$A/mark.png\" \"$MARK\" \"EXACTLY ONE full person: MARK standing outside a simple doodle house, arms crossed tightly, frustrated expression, looking at the house. In one window of the house there is a plain solid-black SILHOUETTE shape of a person — just a flat black shape, no features. The house has one board nailed across a lower window. Centered composition, generous open cornflower-blue space around. EXACTLY ONE full person plus one flat black window silhouette.\" ;;\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_8A.sh:47:  gen \"m08_L8A_b07_leaseback.png\" \"$A/grace.png\" \"$GRACE\" \"EXACTLY ONE person: GRACE the elderly woman sitting comfortably in her yellow armchair inside her living room, holding her teacup, content expression. Beside the armchair are two or three stacked flat cardboard-kraft moving boxes, packed and closed. On a small side table next to her sits a single large door key. Scene composed in the LEFT and CENTER of the frame; keep the bottom-right corner area completely empty cornflower-blue (space reserved for a circle overlay). EXACTLY ONE PERSON.\" ;;\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_8A.sh:49:  gen \"m08_L8A_b08_privacy.png\" \"$A/carol.png\" \"$CAROL\" \"CAROL standing at the front door of her simple doodle house, close to the door, guarded posture with one hand resting on the door frame. Her front yard is completely EMPTY — plain flat ground, pointedly nothing in it, no sign, no objects. At the far side of the yard a low simple fence, and TWO nosy neighbors (simple doodle people in cream and orange) peek over the top of the fence, only their heads and hands visible above the fence line. Centered composition. EXACTLY THREE PEOPLE total: Carol full-body, two neighbor heads over the fence.\" ;;\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_8A.sh:51:  gen \"m08_L8A_b09_contract.png\" \"$A/ray.png\" \"$RAY\" \"EXACTLY ONE person: RAY seated at a simple table with one large white contract document page on it — the page shows only plain horizontal doodle lines as text placeholders and one empty signature line at the bottom, no readable words. RAY holds a pen HOVERING above the signature line, hesitant nervous expression, other hand touching his cheek. Scene composed in the LEFT and CENTER of the frame; keep the bottom-right corner area completely empty cornflower-blue (space reserved for a circle overlay). EXACTLY ONE PERSON.\" ;;\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_scenes_2B.sh:17:  echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/$file (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached style references exactly, and the person is the SAME character as the attached portrait $portrait — IDENTICAL face and build: $face SCENE: $scene The person is a full or half-length figure standing/seated within the scene (NOT a head-and-shoulders portrait). Weary, worn, honest emotional tone — no smiling. $STYLE $capsnote EXACTLY ONE PERSON in the whole image, no second person, no clone, no reflection of the person.\" | \\\ndocs/course-production/scripts/_scene_logs/beth.log:3:I attempted the explicit `gpt-image-2` CLI path first, but the local shell had no `OPENAI_API_KEY` and no installed `openai` Python package. I used the built-in image generation path and flattened the selected result locally. Source image preserved under `~/.codex/generated_images/...`.\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_3A.sh:19:  echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/$file (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached style references exactly. COMPOSITION: $desc $style\" | \\\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_3A.sh:27:  echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/$file (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached style references exactly. The woman wearing the phone headset (our BMH representative) must have the IDENTICAL face to the attached headset reference image: tiny dot eyes, small simple nose, simple friendly smile, same headset. COMPOSITION: $desc $STYLE\" | \\\ndocs/course-production/scripts/_scene_logs/ray.log:3:Note: the local explicit `gpt-image-2` CLI path could not run because `OPENAI_API_KEY` is missing, so I used the established built-in image workflow and normalized the output locally. Drift surfaced but not changed because it is outside this image task: `_Active.md` and `mocs/MOC - v1.md` still reference Sandra PR #301 where newer vault context points to PR #306.\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_2B.sh:16:  echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/$file (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached style references exactly. COMPOSITION: $desc $style\" | \\\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_4A.sh:14:  echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/$file (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached style references exactly. COMPOSITION: $desc $STYLE\" | \\\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_beth_v2.sh:10:echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/$FILE (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached style references exactly, and the standing woman is the SAME character as the attached portrait m02_L2B_beth.png — IDENTICAL face and build: ONE doodle woman in her early forties, medium build, shoulder-length BLACK hair (NOT grey, NOT elderly), no glasses, white shirt, pale near-white cream face, quiet grieving tired expression. SCENE: Beth stands INSIDE her late mother's quiet LIVING ROOM. Simple flat brand-style room — a plain sofa, a small side table, a rug, a window — clean minimal flat doodle shapes. PROMINENTLY on the WALL BEHIND her hangs a large FRAMED MEMORIAL PORTRAIT of her late mother: a framed head-and-shoulders picture of an ELDERLY woman with short grey/white hair, round gentle face, pale cream face — clearly a photo of someone who has passed. Beth stands quietly, one hand at her side, subdued and grieving, looking around the empty room. Beth is a full or half-length standing figure (NOT a head-and-shoulders portrait). Weary, no smiling. \"$STYLE\" IMPORTANT: there is EXACTLY ONE living/real person in the scene (Beth). The ONLY other face allowed is the DRAWN portrait inside the picture frame on the wall (the late mother) — that is a framed picture, not a second live person. No other people, no clones, no reflections. No text or words anywhere; the framed photo shows a drawn face, not text.\" | \\\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_carol_argue.sh:10:echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/$FILE (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached style references exactly. This is a TWO-PERSON scene. LEFT person = Carol, the SAME character as the attached portrait m02_L2B_carol.png — IDENTICAL face and build: a woman in her sixties, short curly LIGHT-GREY hair, ROUND GLASSES, cream shirt, pale near-white cream face; now looking FRUSTRATED and mid-argument, one hand raised gesturing, the other holding up a single sheet of paper marked LIEN. RIGHT person = a CONTRACTOR (a NEW, different character, clearly NOT Carol): a man in a work CAP and a TOOL BELT, plain cream/orange work clothes, pale near-white cream face; he is ALSO ANGRY — brow furrowed, scowling mouth, one hand thrown out or jabbing a finger back toward Carol, arguing BACK at her (NOT apologizing, NOT sheepish). BOTH people are visibly ANGRY and mid-shout — this is a heated TWO-WAY argument, both scowling at each other. Between them on the ground is the abandoned half-finished repair: a leaning step LADDER and an open PAINT CAN with a brush. Keep the cornflower-blue background BEHIND them completely PLAIN and EMPTY — NO wall, NO gray patch, NO paint patch, nothing on the background. \"$STYLE\" One short caps word LIEN is allowed on the paper Carol holds; keep letters clean and legible; no other text anywhere. EXACTLY TWO people in the whole image (Carol on the left, the contractor on the right) — no clone, no third person, no duplicate, no reflection; each person has exactly one head and two arms.\" | \\\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_7A.sh:22:  echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/$file (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached style references exactly and keep the character IDENTICAL to the attached character reference. CHARACTER: $ident COMPOSITION: $desc $STYLE $NEG\" | \\\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_3B.sh:17:  echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/$file (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached style references exactly. COMPOSITION: $desc $style\" | \\\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_2A_v4.sh:13:  echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/$file (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached style references exactly. COMPOSITION: $desc $style\" | \\\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_TEMPLATE.sh:14:  echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/$file (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached style references exactly. COMPOSITION: $desc $style\" | \\\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_5A.sh:17:  echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/$file (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached style references exactly. COMPOSITION: $desc $style\" | \\\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_5A.sh:25:  echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/$file (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached style references exactly. The woman wearing the phone headset (our BMH representative) must have the IDENTICAL face to the attached headset reference image: tiny dot eyes, small simple nose, simple friendly smile, same headset. COMPOSITION: $desc $STYLE\" | \\\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_2A_v2.sh:19:  echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/m02_L2A_office_andrea.png (PNG, 1600x900). The FIRST attached image is Andrea — reproduce her face and hair EXACTLY: same tiny dot eyes, small nose, simple smile, same dark curly hair. COMPOSITION: Full-body doodle illustration of Andrea standing in a simple office, warm and friendly, hands relaxed at her sides, front-facing. A simple office desk with a chair sits to one side. On the wall directly behind her is the B|M|H logo lockup reproduced from the last two attached logo references (serif capitals B, M, H separated by thin vertical divider bars, dark green badge). Andrea centered, her full body visible from head to feet with a little floor space beneath her, generous plain cornflower-blue space around her. STYLE: flat sticker-sheet illustration, thick black hand-drawn outlines with a slight wobble, flat fills only (yellow, orange, cream, white, black) on cornflower-blue background, no gradients, no shadows, no perspective. The ONLY text allowed is the B M H logo lockup on the wall; its dark green badge is a permitted brand exception. No other letters, numbers, or words anywhere. 16:9 composition, 1600x900.\" | \\\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_2A_v2.sh:26:  echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/m02_L2A_b10_outofstate.png (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached doodle style. COMPOSITION: The frame is split into two halves by one straight horizontal black line across the middle. TOP HALF is a cold snowy winter scene: a simple little cream house with an orange roof sitting in deep white snow, two simple pale mountain peaks behind it, and a few falling snowflakes. BOTTOM HALF is a warm sunny beach: ONE relaxed homeowner lounging back on a beach chair wearing big black sunglasses, arms behind the head, with a simple palm tree, a round sun, and a strip of sandy ground. The contrast reads as the owner relaxing far away in the sun while their property sits alone in the snow. Exactly one person, in the bottom beach half only. $STYLE_SCENIC\" | \\\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_2A_v2.sh:33:  echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/m02_L2A_b18_angrycaller.png (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached doodle style. COMPOSITION: ONE cast-board-style homeowner seated at a simple desk, visibly angry and fed up: eyebrows furrowed low, mouth in a hard frown. One hand is slamming down flat on the desk, the other hand is snatching up an old-fashioned corded phone handset toward the ear. A simple phone base with a cord sits on the desk in front of them. Exactly one person, no clone, no second person. Centered, generous plain cornflower-blue space around. $STYLE\" | \\\ndocs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_2A_v2.sh:40:  echo \"Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to $OUT/m02_L2A_b20_handshake.png (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached doodle style. COMPOSITION: An extreme close-up of two hands clasped in a warm, firm handshake, filling most of the frame. Two forearms come in from the left and the right and meet in the center: the LEFT sleeve is cream, the RIGHT sleeve is orange, so they clearly read as two different people. Simple doodle hands with thick black outlines, flat fills, a couple of simple knuckle and finger lines. Centered on plain cornflower-blue. No faces, no bodies, just the two hands and forearms shaking. $STYLE\" | \\\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"019f3874-d51f-7690-9f2c-44ee1cb8e3d9"}}}
